# Copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# TWO KINDS OF VARIABLE, and the difference matters:
#
#   VITE_*   read at BUILD time and baked into the browser bundle. Changing one
#            in Vercel does NOTHING until you redeploy. They are public — the
#            anon key is meant to be, and is gated by row-level security.
#   others   server-only, read at request time by the functions in api/.
#            NEVER prefix a secret with VITE_ or it ships to every visitor.

# ── Supabase (browser) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Settings → API. The app requires these: without them it renders a diagnostic
# naming what is missing rather than a blank page (see src/main.tsx).
# The URL is repaired on the way in — surrounding quotes, stray whitespace, a
# trailing slash and a pasted dashboard URL are all handled (src/lib/supabase.ts).
# Both `core` and `sales` must be listed under Settings → API → Exposed schemas.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ── AI proxy — /api/claude, server-only ─────────────────────────────────────
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional. Defaults to claude-haiku-4-5 (cheapest — $1/$5 per Mtok). Set to
# claude-sonnet-5 ($3/$15) for sharper stage-gate interviews, or claude-opus-4-8
# ($5/$25) for maximum quality.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=

# ── Google Drive — /api/drive, server-only ──────────────────────────────────
# One folder per company under a shared root. Unset → the app shows its
# "not connected" card and every Drive feature stays dark; nothing breaks.
# The service account's key file, as the full JSON or the same base64-encoded:
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=
# The Drive folder that holds all company folders. Share it with the service
# account's client_email as Editor, or nothing is visible to the tool.
DRIVE_ROOT_FOLDER_ID=

# ── Fireflies — /api/fireflies, server-only ─────────────────────────────────
# Settings → Developer Settings. API access requires a PAID Fireflies plan; a
# free-plan key authenticates fine and then returns nothing, which looks like a
# bug and is not one. Unset → the scrum transcript pull is hidden.
FIREFLIES_API_KEY=

# ── Health check only (scripts/check-sales.mjs --db) ────────────────────────
# The same two public values as the VITE_ pair above, without the prefix, so
# the check script can query PostgREST directly. Never needed at runtime.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
